hl.gesture_handoff("workspace"), called from a Lua gesture's start callback, hands the
rest of that swipe to the built-in interactive workspace swipe: the 4-finger vertical
swipe walks the column like Mod+J/K and only at its end follows the fingers into the
next workspace (features/hyprland/hyprland.lua).

